# Devices, Channels & Data Separation

## Capture / verification methods (use where design requires)

| Method | Typical use |
|---|---|
| Fingerprint / facial recognition | Guard attendance & alertness; customer employee access; parking driver verify |
| GPS mobile check-in | Guard attendance, alertness, patrols |
| QR code | Attendance, visitor codes, parking permits, checkpoints |
| NFC checkpoint / tags | Patrols, alertness, attendance |
| RFID card / tag | Parking, access, vehicles |
| Smart parking permit | Parking access |
| ANPR cameras | Parking / vehicle entry (results → Nest; processing in vision AI) |
| Barrier gates / access controllers | Parking & premises entry |
| CCTV + AI alerts | Monitoring portal; **Nest receives events/metadata only** — video on NVR/MinIO |
| Supervisor confirmation | Attendance / alertness / shift verification |
| Photo / selfie / short security task | Alertness confirmation |
| Manual gate officer approval | Exception / suspicious cases |

## Notification & payment channels

SMS · Email · WhatsApp · Push · system notification  
Banks · Mobile money (M-Pesa, TigoPesa, Airtel Money, HaloPesa) · payment gateways  

Wire through `integration-gateway` + adapters — not hard-coded into domain libs.

## Mobile apps (field)

- **Guard app** — attendance, alertness, patrols, parking patrol, incidents (offline-first)
- **Supervisor app** — verify attendance/alertness, inspections, replacements
- **Gate verification app** — visitor codes, staff cards, parking permits, vehicle entry

## Hard data separation (§33) — never mix

Keep separate models/schemas/permissions for:

company employees · guards · **guard attendance** · **guard alertness** · **customer employee attendance/access** · customer payroll · visitors · parking · suppliers · applicants · other security companies · customers · vehicles · service providers

```text
❌ Shared attendance table for guards + customer staff
✅ attendance.* (guards) vs access.* (customer employees) + organization_id/customer_id + RLS
```

## Module feature anchors (do not drop when finishing incomplete work)

- **Alertness:** post clock-in; scheduled/random; miss → alert Supervisor/Field/BOM/Control Room; feeds payroll/discipline/customer reports  
- **Visitors:** online appointment → host approve → unique code (SMS/email/WhatsApp) → gate scan → deny if invalid/expired/used  
- **Parking:** register vehicles, allocate spaces, entry/exit, violations, permits, optional billing, ANPR/RFID/CCTV alerts, blacklist  
- **Payroll:** company vs **customer-managed** payroll separate; e-payroll due only if invoice **fully paid**; immutable snapshots  
- **Loans:** boots, smartphone, cash, uniform, emergency, salary advance — approval + payroll deduction  
- **EOB:** append-only; no silent delete/edit without approval + audit  
- **Petty cash / vouchers:** no issue without approval workflow  

## Design §37 reminder

One integrated platform + web portals + mobile + biometrics/QR/RFID/NFC/ANPR/CCTV + notifications + payments — **nationwide**, secure, scalable, auditable.
